      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The weapons factory is the place where you unlock new turrets, each extra
    level unlocks an extra turret and provides either a damage boost (if the current
    level is even) or a reload boost (if the current level is odd). It is important
    to keep its fulfilment to 100% to help the war effort. For this building gain
    is separate for cost/reward.
